<section class="section--tight">
  <div class="container" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;">
    <div class="fade-in">
      <p>Jaipur has been a center of marble carving for generations, and it is within this heritage that <%= settings.businessName %> works today. Every murti that leaves our workshop passes through the hands of artisans who learned the craft the traditional way — chisel by chisel, under the guidance of senior karigars.</p>
      <p>We work primarily in Makrana and Italian marble, shaping everything from small home-temple murtis to large statues destined for temple garbhagrihas across India and overseas. Each piece is carved to order, finished by hand, and inspected before it ever leaves the workshop.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.85rem;">Specific figures such as years in operation, number of murtis completed, and client lists are kept accurate and up to date by our team — see the trust statistics on our homepage for current numbers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-in" style="background:var(--muted-beige); border-radius: var(--radius-md); aspect-ratio:4/5;"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--beige">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head fade-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">What Guides Us</span>
