    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card-testimonial fade-in">
        <h3>Marble Expertise</h3>
        <p class="muted">Deep knowledge of Makrana, Italian, and coloured marble — matched to the right statue and setting.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-testimonial fade-in">
        <h3>Artisan Team</h3>
        <p class="muted">Carvers and finishers trained in Jaipur's long-standing sculpture tradition, working entirely by hand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-testimonial fade-in">
        <h3>Quality Standards</h3>
        <p class="muted">Every statue is inspected for proportion, finish, and structural integrity before packaging.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-testimonial fade-in">
        <h3>Domestic Delivery</h3>
        <p class="muted">Careful packaging and transport of statues, from small murtis to large temple installations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-testimonial fade-in">
        <h3>International Delivery</h3>
        <p class="muted">Export experience for overseas temples and collectors, with documentation handled for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-testimonial fade-in">
        <h3>Custom Manufacturing</h3>
